  "releaseNotes": "- Apply saved Flyleaf and D3D11 filter preferences in place, preserve synchronization settings, and reset omitted filters to neutral\n\t\t- Add offscreen video frame extraction from resolved media inputs\n\t\t- Support cancellable keyframe and accurate preview requests that return frozen WPF bitmaps\n\t\t- Extract live HLS keyframe previews by matching media sequences across sliding playlist windows\n\t\t- Publish HLS window duration changes and coalesce once-per-second playback time updates",
